<SECTION image-layout="right">
  <IMG class="accent-image" query="diverse startup founders in lab setting working on climate technology">
  <DIV class="body">
    <H2><B>Climate VC funding hits <SPAN text-color="#0080FF">$48B</SPAN> despite economic <SPAN text-color="#0080FF">headwinds</SPAN></B></H2>
    <P>While overall venture funding dropped 35%, climate tech investments grew <SPAN text-color="#0080FF">12% year-over-year</SPAN>. Energy storage and carbon management lead with $14B and $11B respectively.</P>
    <P>Geographic diversification accelerates beyond Silicon Valley. European climate startups raised <SPAN text-color="#0080FF">$18B</SPAN>, while Asian markets contributed $12B — particularly in battery technology and solar manufacturing.</P>
    <P>Later-stage funding dominates as investors prioritize proven technologies over early R&D. Series C+ rounds account for <SPAN text-color="#0080FF">60% of total climate venture capital</SPAN>.</P>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>